        # [CRIT] "seemed less like a correction than a ritual obliteration" — LOADED EMBELLISHMENT introducing ritual/ceremonial claim not in RECORD.
        # [CRIT] "consumed not by flame, but by some deeper, more ancient hunger" — INVENTION of agency/intent not in RECORD.
        # [CRIT] "reduced to the banal: routine wire traffic, faintly curious, slightly off" — CONTRADICTION; RECORD says "routine" and "slightly unusual," not "faintly curious, slightly off."
        # [CRIT] "just enough to stir the mind to unease, just enough to make the silence of the room seem like the pause before a scream" — PC INTERIORITY (Ossal's emotional/mental state).
