        # [LOW] "a dry throat in the silence" — LOADED EMBELLISHMENT: personification that adds metaphorical claim not in RECORD.
        # [CRIT] "cooled, dark, like the kiss of something that had burned too long" — INVENTION: "cooled," "dark," and the comparative "kiss of something" are not in RECORD; RECORD only notes "faint smudge of ash."
